## How to Turn ffuf Results into a Bug Report
To turn an anomaly into a paid bounty, look for changes in three metrics:

                  ┌───────────────────────────┐
                  │   Look for Deviations     │
                  └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                                │
         ┌──────────────────────┼──────────────────────┐
         ▼                      ▼                      ▼
  Status Codes             Byte Size              Word Count
(e.g., 405 instead     (e.g., 200 OK with     (e.g., A 403 page with
   of a 404)             larger payload)       0 words vs 500 words)

